There's a typo in the release notes for the configuration variable, "TASK_RUNNER" should be "TEST_RUNNER".

To save folks time, here's my relevant setting, which reverts to the previous default runner, `unittest`:
```json
{
  "Python": {
    "tasks": {
      "variables": {
        "TEST_RUNNER": "unittest"
      }
    }
  }
}
```

Big thanks to y'all for continuing to make Zed awesome! ❤️
